-- For l4 batch: the function answers at once, but the file it imports,
-- stoplib.l4, has an #EVAL that never ends. That #EVAL is worked out with
-- every row, so under a time limit it stops the batch at row 1, and the
-- batch says where the run stopped.
IMPORT stoplib

@export default twice the number
GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
twice n MEANS n TIMES 2
